    slug: "starting-tech-career-nigeria-2026",
    title: "Starting a tech career in Nigeria: a practical guide for 2026",
    excerpt:
      "The landscape has changed. Here is what actually works right now for breaking into tech from Nigeria.",
    category: "Career",
    author: "Cyber Elias Academy",
